<title>USA: St Joseph hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOSEPH 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said compared with</p>
<p>Tuesday, barrows and gilts were $0.50 lower. Interior Iowa</p>
<p>moved 79,000 hogs Tuesday. Top $54.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3	230-270 lbs    54.00-54.50</p>
<p>    US 2-3	270-290 lbs    52.50-53.50</p>
<p>Sows - steady. Top $54.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-2    300-450 lbs    45.00</p>
<p>		  450-500 lbs    47.00</p>
<p>    US 1-3    500-550 lbs    51.00</p>
<p>		  550-700 lbs    53.00-54.00</p>
<p>    Boars - 300-700 lbs    41.00</p>
<p>		200-300 lbs    42.00</p>
</text>
